{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1401010431","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1401010431","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434001:":{"text":"有印记的罪人！快滚出来！","source_cn":"有印记的罪人！快滚出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE64044C2A64315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434002:":{"text":"我不是为自己而来的……","source_cn":"我不是为自己而来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17C51449788E69FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434003:":{"text":"贝丝薇快不行了……求你们","source_cn":"贝丝薇快不行了……求你们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76E7B0423D97084F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434004:":{"text":"这就是触犯律法的代价！","source_cn":"这就是触犯律法的代价！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D7E34ED469A5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434005:":{"text":"出什么事了？","source_cn":"出什么事了？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EA49D203F198EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410435001:0":{"text":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍，被我揪出来了！","source_cn":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD74C86F1868F943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410435002:1":{"text":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","source_cn":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037B6D3F7EBE6744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410435003:1":{"text":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","source_cn":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61771932570AE04D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410435004:0":{"text":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","source_cn":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A0B81741CE86B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410435005:1":{"text":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","source_cn":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A7FD1001E02691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410435006:0":{"text":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无辜者吗？","source_cn":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533BD077FC0B2E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410435007:0":{"text":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","source_cn":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2F04F3999034BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410435008:1":{"text":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","source_cn":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF0F4E8E72F0E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410435009:0":{"text":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","source_cn":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6B85A74E0C7EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410435010:0":{"text":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","source_cn":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2690421B342FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410435011:0":{"text":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","source_cn":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57829F2BFA423FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"",