"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1410439003:1":{"text":"都是你们的错！是你们害的！先是贝丝薇，又是凯登！","source_cn":"都是你们的错！是你们害的！先是贝丝薇，又是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0877928701B835F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1410439004:1":{"text":"你拿着武器，要做什么？是不是要斩下他们的头颅！","source_cn":"你拿着武器，要做什么？是不是要斩下他们的头颅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306495E9358A91A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1410439005:1":{"text":"杀人犯！刽子手！","source_cn":"杀人犯！刽子手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2896D7D024E2B776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1410439006:1":{"text":"我们为萨洛克兰付出了很多！不……我们付出了一切！然而这就是我们的回报？","source_cn":"我们为萨洛克兰付出了很多！不……我们付出了一切！然而这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB59E3B3ACAF059CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1410439007:0":{"text":"索伦说的没错！知识和资源被贵族们垄断，我们拼尽全力爬到上面……却因为小事而滑落深渊！","source_cn":"索伦说的没错！知识和资源被贵族们垄断，我们拼尽全力爬到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766DD21D52342E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1410439008:0":{"text":"世世代代重复着所谓的命运，时时刻刻面临着孽化产生的风险！这是我们的宿命吗?","source_cn":"世世代代重复着所谓的命运，时时刻刻面临着孽化产生的风险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF9604E85912A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1410439009:0":{"text":"诸位，我了解你们的痛苦。我也同样是平民出身……","source_cn":"诸位，我了解你们的痛苦。我也同样是平民出身……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275DFEF74446402C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1410439010:0":{"text":"但现在最重要的是阻止孽化蔓延，请让开！","source_cn":"但现在最重要的是阻止孽化蔓延，请让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB428C355F6BCECDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1410439011:0":{"text":"我受够了！我们凭什么要承受这些？","source_cn":"我受够了！我们凭什么要承受这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF5391A298CFB04B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1410439012:1":{"text":"凯登的今日就是我们的明天！拦住他们，不能再让这些刽子手伤害我们的同伴了！","source_cn":"凯登的今日就是我们的明天！拦住他们，不能再让这些刽子手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x103EDCCD837D324B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:60:14010433:0":{"text":"你在排队领取灵露时，凯登再次混入了队伍。但他在此过程中突然孽化，引起了骚乱。","source_cn":"你在排队领取灵露时，